---
description: coSlash code style — comment discipline, build-target hygiene, docs that match real behavior
globs: **/*.go,**/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/Makefile,**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the coSlash style note in @.agents/skills/coding-style-note-coslash/SKILL.md.

- Comment only TODOs, inferable-nowhere-else constraints, and deliberate special cases. Never narrate logic.
- A build target must clear the generated state it consumes, so no target inherits another's artifacts.
- Document commands, ports, and URLs that actually work for the mode described, and run them first.
